[program:acme-task]
Runs /srv/acme/bin/run.sh as you. Starts with supervisord, restarts it only if it exits with an unexpected code, and gives it 10 seconds to stop. Output goes to an auto-named file in supervisord's log folder. Errors go to an auto-named file in supervisord's log folder.
! acme-task has no stderr_logfile, so errors go to an auto-named file in supervisord's log folder.
